{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52598","headline":"无相颂（亦名《灭罪颂》） · 慧能","name":"无相颂（亦名《灭罪颂》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愚人修福不修道，谓言修福而是道。\n布施供养福无边，心中三恶元来造。\n若将修福欲灭罪，後世得福罪元在。\n若解向除罪缘，各自性中真忏悔。\n若悟大乘真忏悔，除邪行正即无罪。\n学道之人能自观，即与悟人同一类。\n大师令传此顿教，愿学之人同一体。\n若欲当来觅本身，三毒恶缘心中洗。\n努力修道莫悠悠，忽然虚度一世休。\n若遇大乘顿教法，虔诚合掌至心求。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}